  "raw_text": "PLAN \"Week 5 Deload - Post Hypertrophy Block\"\nTYPE workout\nVISIBILITY public\n\nGOALS\n  GOAL primary hypertrophy:\n    name \"Recover from high-volume block and resensitise for next block\"\n\nPHASES\n  PHASE \"Deload\" (1 weeks):\n    WEEK 1:\n      DAY Monday training 40m \"Upper Push Deload\":\n        warmup:\n          rowing 5m\n          arm_circles 1m\n        main straight_sets:\n          bench_press 2x6..8 rpe 6 rest 120 seconds\n          incline_press 2x8..10 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n          shoulder_press 2x8..10 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n          lateral_raise 2x12..15 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n          tricep_pushdown 2x10..12 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          chest_stretch 2m\n          shoulder_stretch 2m\n      DAY Tuesday training 40m \"Lower Squat Deload\":\n        warmup:\n          cycling 5m\n          leg_swings 1m\n        main straight_sets:\n          squat 2x5..6 rpe 6 rest 150 seconds\n          leg_press 2x8..10 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n          leg_extension 2x10..12 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n          leg_curl 2x10..12 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n          standing_calf_raise 2x10..12 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          quad_stretch 2m\n          hip_flexor_stretch 2m\n      DAY Wednesday rest\n      DAY Thursday training 40m \"Upper Pull Deload\":\n        warmup:\n          rowing 5m\n          scapular_retraction 1m\n        main straight_sets:\n          barbell_row 2x6..8 rpe 6 rest 120 seconds\n          lat_pulldown 2x8..10 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n          cable_row 2x8..10 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n          face_pull 2x12..15 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n          bicep_curl 2x10..12 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          lat_stretch 2m\n          back_stretch 2m\n      DAY Friday training 40m \"Lower Hinge Deload\":\n        warmup:\n          cycling 5m\n          hip_circles 1m\n        main straight_sets:\n          romanian_deadlift 2x6..8 rpe 6 rest 120 seconds\n          hip_thrust 2x8..10 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n          walking_lunge 2x8..10 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n          leg_curl 2x10..12 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n          seated_calf_raise 2x12..15 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          hamstring_stretch 2m\n          pigeon_pose 2m\n      DAY Saturday training 30m \"Active Recovery\":\n        warmup:\n          walking 10m\n        main straight_sets:\n          dead_bug 2x10 rpe 5 rest 45 seconds\n          bird_dog 2x10 rpe 5 rest 45 seconds\n          pallof_press 2x10 rpe 5 rest 45 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          cat_cow 2m\n          child_pose 2m\n      DAY Sunday rest",
